<div class="tsp-pro"><div class="act-light">
<section class="sec" style="padding-top:30px" id="compare">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center">
        <h2>選一顆適合你的鈦山。</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede cmp-lede" style="text-align:center;margin:14px auto 0;max-width:34em">行動電源怎麼挑？三台都是準固態電芯、都做過同一套安全測試。Air 極致輕薄、TITANSHIELD 日常均衡、Pro 旗艦效能——挑你要的那一種。</p>
      <div class="cmp-togglewrap"><button type="button" id="cmptoggle" aria-expanded="false"><i>＋</i>展開三款比較</button></div>
      <div class="mac-panel">
        <div class="mac-cols">
          <div class="mac-col">
            <div class="cmp-shot"><img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-cmp-air.png' | asset_url }}" alt="TITANSHIELD Air"></div>
            <h3>TITANSHIELD Air</h3>
            <p class="role2">極致輕薄款</p>
            <p class="tagline">薄到你會忘記它在口袋裡。</p>
            <p class="pr">NT$ 1,980</p>
            <div class="acts"><a class="more" href="https://grantclassic.com/products/titanshield-air">進一步了解</a><a class="golink" href="https://grantclassic.com/products/titanshield-air">購買 ›</a></div>
            <div class="mdiv"></div>
            <div class="mstat"><b>5,000<em>mAh</em></b><span>電池容量</span></div>
            <div class="mstat"><b>15W</b><span>無線輸出</span></div>
            <div class="mstat"><b>6<em>mm</em></b><span>機身厚度</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mac-col">
            <div class="cmp-shot"><img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-cmp-std.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="TITANSHIELD"></div>
            <h3>TITANSHIELD</h3>
            <p class="role2">日常均衡款</p>
            <p class="tagline">五合一充電，一台抵一桌線。</p>
            <p class="pr">NT$ 1,980 起</p>
            <div class="acts"><a class="more" href="https://grantclassic.com/products/solid-state-power-bank-titanshield-10000mah">進一步了解</a><a class="golink" href="https://grantclassic.com/products/solid-state-power-bank-titanshield-10000mah">購買 ›</a></div>
            <div class="mdiv"></div>
            <div class="mstat"><b>5,000／10,000<em>mAh</em></b><span>電池容量</span></div>
            <div class="mstat"><b>15W</b><span>無線輸出</span></div>
            <div class="mstat"><b>Watch 充電</b><span>Apple Watch 磁吸充電</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mac-col">
            <div class="cmp-shot"><img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-cmp-pro.png' | asset_url }}" alt="TITANSHIELD Pro"></div>
            <h3>TITANSHIELD Pro</h3>
            <p class="role2">旗艦效能款</p>
            <p class="tagline">容量加倍，還會在出事前先叫你。</p>
            <p class="pr">NT$ 2,980</p>
            <div class="acts"><span class="here">目前查看的機型</span><a class="golink" href="#buy">購買 ›</a></div>
            <div class="mdiv"></div>
            <div class="mstat"><b>10,000<em>mAh</em></b><span>電池容量</span></div>
            <div class="mstat"><b>25W</b><span>Qi2 無線快充</span></div>
            <div class="mstat"><b>警鈴＋TFT</b><span>防爆警鈴與智慧螢幕</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <details class="cmp-toggle">
          <summary>完整規格對照</summary>
          <div class="cmp-scroll">
        <table class="cmp">
          <thead><tr>
            <th></th>
            <th>Air<span class="role">極致輕薄款</span></th>
            <th>TITANSHIELD<span class="role">日常均衡款</span></th>
            <th class="pro-col">Pro<span class="role">旗艦效能款</span></th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>電池容量</td><td>5,000 mAh</td><td>5,000 / 10,000 mAh</td><td class="pro-col"><b>10,000 mAh</b></td></tr>
            <tr><td>無線輸出</td><td>15W</td><td>15W</td><td class="pro-col"><b>25W（Qi2.2）</b></td></tr>
            <tr><td>有線輸出</td><td>18W</td><td>20W</td><td class="pro-col"><b>30W</b></td></tr>
            <tr><td>機身厚度</td><td><b>6 mm</b></td><td>11 / 19 mm</td><td class="pro-col">13 mm</td></tr>
            <tr><td>重量</td><td><b>113 g</b></td><td>155 / 255 g</td><td class="pro-col">214 g</td></tr>
            <tr><td>電芯</td><td>準固態鋰離子</td><td>準固態鋰離子</td><td class="pro-col">準固態鋰離子</td></tr>
            <tr><td>電量顯示</td><td><span class="dash">—</span></td><td><span class="dash">—</span></td><td class="pro-col"><b>TFT 智慧螢幕</b></td></tr>
            <tr><td>折疊支架</td><td><span class="dash">—</span></td><td><span class="dash">—</span></td><td class="pro-col"><b>隱藏式支架</b></td></tr>
            <tr><td>防爆警鈴</td><td><span class="dash">—</span></td><td><span class="dash">—</span></td><td class="pro-col"><span class="ok">✓</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Apple Watch 充電</td><td><span class="dash">—</span></td><td><span class="ok">✓</span></td><td class="pro-col"><span class="dash">—</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>AirPods 充電</td><td><span class="ok">✓</span></td><td><span class="ok">✓</span></td><td class="pro-col"><span class="ok">✓</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>溫度保護</td><td>NTC 感測降載</td><td>NTC 感測降載</td><td class="pro-col">NTC 感測降載</td></tr>
            <tr><td>建議售價</td><td>NT$ 1,980</td><td>NT$ 1,980 起</td><td class="pro-col"><b>NT$ 2,980</b></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
          <p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2)">標準款有 5,000 與 10,000 兩種容量，表中以斜線並列。</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center" style="margin-bottom:28px">
        <h2 style="font-size:26px">通過的認證，查得到的字號。</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="certrow" aria-label="認證與保固卡片，可左右滑動">
        <div class="certcard"><div class="certfig"><img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-cert-qi.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="WPC Qi 認證證書"></div><b>WPC Qi2 25W</b><span>QI-ID 27410・MPP25・2026/06 認證</span></div>
        <div class="certcard"><div class="certfig"><img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-cert-chemitox.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="日本 CHEMITOX 釘刺試驗報告書"></div><b>日本 CHEMITOX</b><span>釘刺試驗報告書（10000／5000mAh）</span></div>
        <div class="certcard"><div class="certfig"><img src="{{ 'tsp-daily-cert-sgs.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="SGS 檢驗報告"></div><b>SGS</b><span>電芯安全檢驗・報告編號 HE40037／2026</span></div>
        <div class="certcard"><div class="certfig certfig-txt">R3I037</div><b>BSMI</b><span>台灣經濟部標準檢驗局</span></div>
        <div class="certcard"><div class="certfig certfig-txt">CCAP26<br>LP2000T2</div><b>NCC</b><span>國家通訊傳播委員會</span></div>
        <div class="certcard"><div class="certfig certfig-txt">1+1 年</div><b>保固 1+1 年</b><span>登錄後延長（條款文案待確認）</span></div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </section>
</div></div>
